                <note rend="inline" type="source">717.2114/70: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Piles</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-09-15T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                                1928—1 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>55. Has text of treaty between Colombia and Nicaragua of March 24 last been made
                    public in Colombia?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
